; A posting with an assertion and no amount is a balance assignment: it posts
; whatever brings the account to the asserted balance, counted over the
; entries dated before it, however the file orders them, and the elided
; posting beside it takes what is left.

2024-01-05 Statement
    Assets:Checking    = $15.00
    Income:Salary

2024-01-01 Opening, written after the statement
    Assets:Checking    $10.50
    Equity:Opening

2024-01-06 Nothing moved since the statement
    Assets:Checking    = $15.00
    Income:Salary
